==== Opening the case ====

**Note:** This will void your warranty!

  - Remove the four (4) screws from base.
  - Remove top casing.
  - To access serial you also need to remove the two (2) screws holding the circuit board to the base of the case.
  - The serial header is on the bottom of the PCB.

